    <mxCell id="30" value="升级循环（每次经验入账执行）&#xa;&#xa;Experience += ExperienceGain&#xa;while (Level &lt; MaxLevel &amp;&amp; Experience &gt;= ExperienceToNextLevel):&#xa;    Experience -= ExperienceToNextLevel&#xa;    Level += 1&#xa;    ExperienceToNextLevel = 查曲线(Level)&#xa;    AttributePoints += PointsPerLevel&#xa;ExperienceGain = 0&#xa;&#xa;约束：循环必须受 Level &lt; MaxLevel 限制，防止经验表配错导致死循环。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
